# slider-hover (h8-points-slider): the pointer on the thumb (250, 748, on the
# 18 px mark centred at 249.5). The tip "x = 2.00" shows, the thumb scales
# 1.12. Behaviour: aria-valuenow stays 2, no drag.
size 1440 900
density 2
scheme dark
mode dark
theme arctic-ice
wait 500
move 250 748
wait 200
shot slider-hover
